alinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test-projectsettings.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18577512/test-projectsettings.zip)\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** Intel Core i9-13900K\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-5800 C30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Windows 11 24H2\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nUsing a release export template compiled with MSVC 2022. The improvement is mostly seen in `get_setting_with_override()`; `get_setting()` is essentially unaffected.\r\n\r\n### Before\r\n\r\n```\r\nProjectSettings.get_setting(): 364800 usec for 2500000 iterations\r\nProjectSettings.get_setting_with_override(): 436951 usec for 2500000 iterations\r\n```\r\n\r\n### After\r\n\r\n```\r\nProjectSettings.get_setting(): 361875 usec for 2500000 iterations\r\nProjectSettings.get_setting_with_override(): 390053 usec for 2500000 iterations\r\n```","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102126#pullrequestreview-2579046888","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102126","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102126#pullrequestreview-2579046888"},"pull_request":{"href"